				<div class="cx__shortcol">
					<h2 id="cx-short-h" class="cx__shorth">Turning a slow, siloed crown design process into one intelligent editor.</h2>
					<dl class="cx__story">
						<div><dt>The problem</dt><dd><span class="tx-d">The original editor was built fast, by devs. A crown passed through 3+ people and tools, so dental designers spent more time moving files than designing the tooth. They rated it 6.9 out of 10 (3Shape: 9.1), and fewer than half of them used it.</span><div class="tx-m tx-mb mprob">
								<p class="mlead">Dandy’s first Design Editor was built fast, by devs. Dental designers spent more time moving files than designing the tooth.</p>
								<ul class="mstats">
									<li><b>3+</b><div><strong>Programs per crown</strong><p>The prepper, designer and auditor each used a different one. Downloading, uploading and waiting <span class="mem">added design time.</span></p></div></li>
									<li><b>6.9</b><div><strong>Satisfaction score, out of 10</strong><p>From dental designers, against 9.1 for 3Shape, the competitor software.</p></div></li>
									<li><b>46<small>%</small></b><div><strong>Adoption of our editor</strong><p><span class="mem">Fewer than half</span> of dental designers used it. The goal was 100%.</p></div></li>
								</ul>
							</div></dd></div>
						<div><dt>What I owned</dt><dd><span class="tx-d">Two goals: less design time at the same quality, and dental designers choosing our editor over 3Shape. As the sole product designer, working with PMs and engineers, I set the direction, ran the research, built the design system, prototyped in code, and worked with engineers to ship it.</span><div class="tx-m tx-mb mown">
								<p class="mlabel">The goals</p>
								<ul class="mgoals">
									<li><span class="mic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></span><span>Less design time, same quality</span></li>
									<li><span class="mic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M3.5 19c0-3 2.5-5 5.5-5s5.5 2 5.5 5"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"/><path d="M16 14c2.8-.3 5 1.5 5 4.5"/></svg></span><span>Dental designers choose our editor over 3Shape</span></li>
								</ul>
								<p class="mlabel">As the sole product designer, with PMs and engineers, I</p>
								<ul class="mdid">
									<li><span class="mic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M15.5 8.5l-2 5-5 2 2-5z"/></svg></span><span>Set the direction</span></li>
									<li><span class="mic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6"/><path d="M20 20l-4.2-4.2"/></svg></span><span>Ran the research</span></li>
									<li><span class="mic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="13.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3.5" y="13.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="13.5" y="13.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></svg></span><span>Built the design system</span></li>
									<li><span class="mic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8.5 7L3.5 12l5 5M15.5 7l5 5-5 5M13.5 5l-3 14"/></svg></span><span>Prototyped in code</span></li>
									<li><span class="mic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"/></svg></span><span>Tested weekly with dental designers</span></li>
									<li><span class="mic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l2.4 5.6L20 11l-5.6 2.4L12 19l-2.4-5.6L4 11l5.6-2.4z"/></svg></span><span>Designed the ideal version</span></li>
									<li><span class="mic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 8h14M14 4l4 4-4 4M20 16H6M10 12l-4 4 4 4"/></svg></span><span>Partnered with engineering to ship</span></li>
									<li><span class="mic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 20V11M12 20V4M19 20v-6"/></svg></span><span>Tracked the metrics</span></li>
